FFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/agy_usage_windows.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-15p[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-15p/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust normalizer and Gemini weekly anchor rule[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-normalizer[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-normalizer: in sase-core, add agy.rs to normalize the `agy -p [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]/usage --output-format json` envelope into honest model_family-scoped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]windows with the hardening guards (omitted-zero TSV cross-check, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]turn-ran guard, logged-out envelope), add the narrow agy arm to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]is_weekly_all_window, export and bind [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider_usage_normalize_agy_usage, and cover it with fixtures and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hardened agy usage collector and provider hooks[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agy-collector[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-normalizer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agy-collector: add collect_agy_usage (version floor, own process group, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stderr auth-prompt kill, deadline margins, no auto-update, private log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]file), wire AgyProvider usage hooks, raise the sase-core-rs floor and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ratchet the core revision, add a scripted fake-agy test fixture, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document the collector.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Header naming polish, default config, and snapshots[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]header-default[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agy-collector[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-default: render model_family scopes as the bare family in compact[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]header names only, add commented agy indicator examples to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]default_config.yml, pin the shipped-default agy header outcome in tests,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and add agy visual snapshot coverage.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-15p","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-15p.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-efb050f1b2cac46a286cf80e0399f6ef","started_at":"2026-09-21T19:33:46.582136+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-15p","bbugyi200.athena.sase-15p.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-15p.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-15p.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-15p.land"]}
